{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119005741658-1119_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261119012246\"/><p>涉毒被捕尼漢帶走扣查。</p><p>深水埗區警員經深入調查後，昨日（18日）在油麻地廟街進行打擊毒品行動。人員於一個懷疑被用作毒品倉庫的唐樓單位，檢獲約900克懷疑氯胺酮及約70克懷疑可卡因，並以涉嫌「販運危險藥物」拘捕一名25歲尼泊爾裔男子，他現正被扣留調查。行動中，檢獲的毒品總市值約50萬港元。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T17:44:30.123012+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T16:57:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T15:12:35.148654+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T17:37:53.443372+00:00","content_hash":"68d332eeb4464a9d2086ddd044d24f0ce52198b81b46be303a7a681df722a838","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T17:44:30.123012+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}